# Citation metadata for ARPAHLS/mnemolink.
# Validate: pip install cffconvert && cffconvert -i CITATION.cff -f apalike
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  Also record the MnemoLink version you used (PyPI or Git tag) for reproducibility.
type: software
title: "MnemoLink: Curated, injectable personas and artificial memories for AI agents."
abstract: >-
  MnemoLink is an open-source Python framework and curated registry for modular,
  injectable personas, episodic memories, and dynamic lego lineages for AI agents,
  UAVs, robotics, appliances, and BMIs. It decouples experiential context from weights,
  providing standardized 5-kind memory taxonomy, teleological discovery, and prefix-cache-friendly
  mnemonic chunks.
version: "0.2.1"
date-released: "2026-09-12"
